Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:41.16,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Vamos triunfar, sua salvação começou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:47.29,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sem sinais, sem luzes, há tanta confusão
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:49.29,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,360)\blur1.95}Não destrua suas esperanças
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:55.05,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Você me faz perceber de quem eu preciso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:59.64,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,180)\blur1.95}Estarei lá, aguente firme, eles tentarão te mudar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:02.81,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Onde você está agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:05.44,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,80)\blur1.95}Te alcançarei ao amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.31,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,180)\blur1.95}As sombras aparecem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:10.52,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Ilusões nascem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:14.65,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,120)\blur1.95}Os anjos caídos que te acompanham não sabem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:19.10,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur1.95}É a nossa dor que nos torna humanos, afinal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:22.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Fotografias em sépia antigas mostram
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,110)\blur1.95}Nosso frágil mundo precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:27.92,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,540)\blur1.95}Que descartamos ao responder o chamado
